Description: i3 desktop drawn as a drafting sheet
 Draftpaper replaces the bar of an i3 desktop with a drafting sheet: the
 wallpaper is a sheet of paper with a frame, zone ticks and a dot grid, and
 windows end exactly on the frame line. The title block in the corner carries
 the readings a bar would show (time, battery, power, CPU and memory, network,
 temperatures); the margins letter the workspaces and alerts, and windows can
 be parked in the side margins and brought back.
 .
 It runs on i3 under X11, with Quickshell for the live parts.
